{"seconds": 67.1, "exit": 0, "final": "Perfect! So dxe4 is indeed a legal capture of the undefended queen.\n\nThe best move is **Bxg4+** and the main line is: **Bxg4+ Qxg4+ Kh1 Qe4+ dxe4**\n\nThe motif is **attraction** - White's check with Bxg4+ forces (attracts) the Black queen to g4, and then White maneuvers to capture it.\n\n**Coaching Note:**\nWhen your opponent attacks with a minor piece nearby (the knight on g4), look for forcing checks that win material. Bxg4+ forces Black's queen to recapture. After Kh1, Black's checks backfire\u2014Qe4+ allows dxe4, winning the queen. Always calculate forcing moves (checks, captures) to the end before playing.\n\n```json\n{\"move\": \"Bxg4+\", \"line\": [\"Bxg4+\", \"Qxg4+\", \"Kh1\", \"Qe4+\", \"dxe4\"], \"motifs\": [\"attraction\", \"fork\"]}\n```", "tool_calls": [{"tool": "skill", "args": {"skill": "chess-coach"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-board", "args": {"fen": "2kr3r/ppp2ppp/8/1P6/3q2n1/P2Pp3/1RP1B2P/Q4RK1 w - - 2 21"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-threats", "args": {"fen": "2kr3r/ppp2ppp/8/1P6/3q2n1/P2Pp3/1RP1B2P/Q4RK1 w - - 2 21"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-legal_moves", "args": {"fen": "2kr3r/ppp2ppp/8/1P6/3q2n1/P2Pp3/1RP1B2P/Q4RK1 w - - 2 21"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-square_info", "args": {"fen": "2kr3r/ppp2ppp/8/1P6/3q2n1/P2Pp3/1RP1B2P/Q4RK1 w - - 2 21", "square": "g4"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-square_info", "args": {"fen": "2kr3r/ppp2ppp/8/1P6/3q2n1/P2Pp3/1RP1B2P/Q4RK1 w - - 2 21", "square": "f7"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-line_view", "args": {"fen": "2kr3r/ppp2ppp/8/1P6/3q2n1/P2Pp3/1RP1B2P/Q4RK1 w - - 2 21", "square": "e2"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-line_view", "args": {"fen": "2kr3r/ppp2ppp/8/1P6/3q2n1/P2Pp3/1RP1B2P/Q4RK1 w - - 2 21", "square": "f1"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "2kr3r/ppp2ppp/8/1P6/3q2n1/P2Pp3/1RP1B2P/Q4RK1 w - - 2 21", "move": "Rxf7"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspect_move", "args": {"fen": "2kr3R/ppp2Rpp/8/1P6/3q2n1/P2Pp3/1RP1B2P/Q5K1 b - - 0 21", "move": "Qxd3"}}, {"tool": "chess-eyes-inspe